	<key>readme</key>
	<string>ws / workspace: browse desktops, actions, creation and help
space / sp: find and switch desktop
space back: return to the previous desktop
sn &lt;name&gt;: rename the current desktop

Renaming briefly restarts Doorplate and preserves its other settings. Verified for Doorplate 1.6.2. Previous names are backed up in the workflow data folder. Fullscreen Spaces cannot be named.

Naming also changes Automatic color to Transparent; explicit colors are preserved. New desktops keep their default appearance until named with sn or the CLI. No background watcher is installed.</string>
